      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "citation": "Leddy, A., Gottert, A., Haberland, N., Hove, J., West, R., Pettifor, A., Lippman, K., Kahn, K., Mathebula, R., Rebombo, D., Gómez-Olivé, X., Twine, R., Peacock, D, Pulerwitz, J. Shifting gender norms to improve HIV service uptake: Qualitative findings from a large-scale community mobilization intervention in rural South Africa. PLOS One. 2021; in press."
